          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TIT.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tit 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.8.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enf 8:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omuntu weena ayorobere abakama abarikutegyeka; ahakuba tihariho butegyeki obutaruga ahari Ruhanga; kandi abategyeki abariho bateebwaho Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo orikugomera obutegyeki, naaba agomeire eki Ruhanga yaataireho; kandi abarikugoma beereetera orubanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nimumanya ngu abategyeki tibatiinwa barikukora gye, kureka abarikukora kubi. Mbwenu nooyena kutatiina mutegyeki? Kora ebirungi, haza aryakusiima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahabw'okuba we n'omuheereza wa Ruhanga ow'okukuhaisa ebirungi. Kwonka ku oraabe nookora kubi, otiine; ahakuba takwatira busha rurara; kureka n'omuheereza wa Ruhanga, ohoora enzigu aha muntu okora kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo mushemereire kuboorobera, ti habw'okutiina kiniga ekyo kwonka, kureka n'ahabw'eiraka ry'omwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nikyo muheera omushoro, ahakuba abakama abo n'abaheereza ba Ruhanga abeezirika kukora omurimo ogwo obutoosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwihure boona ebi barikubaihuza; abarikushoza mubahe omushoro; abarikuhooza mubahoorere; ab'okutiinwa mubatiine; ab'ekitiinisa mubahe ekitiinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
